This Terraform program creates a DynamoDB table, a Lambda function, and an IAM role with permissions to invoke the Lambda function from the DynamoDB stream. The DynamoDB table is configured with a primary key and a secondary index, and the Lambda function is set up to read from the DynamoDB stream.

