This Terraform program creates the necessary AWS resources to set up an autograder for a CS class. It includes an S3 bucket to store the results, a CodeBuild project to run the students' code, a VPC and subnet for the CodeBuild project, and a security group to control network access. The program also includes an IAM role and KMS key for CodeBuild encryption.

