This Terraform program creates an EC2 instance, an EC2 key pair, a Backup Vault, and a Backup Plan. The EC2 instance is configured with a specific AMI, instance type, key pair, subnet, and VPC. The Backup Plan is set to back up the EC2 instance daily at midnight. The program uses default values for the subnet and VPC IDs, which should be replaced with actual values specific to your AWS environment.

