This Terraform program creates an AWS Lightsail PostgreSQL database with a final snapshot on deletion. It includes a `aws_lightsail_database` resource with required attributes and a `aws_db_snapshot` resource that references the database being deleted. The `availability_zone` is set to a default value of `us-east-1a`.

